[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9786.23, "timestamp": "02:43:06", "text": "嘿，保存一下。运行它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9788.15, "timestamp": "02:43:08", "text": "所以，正式来说，它将会……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9790.87, "timestamp": "02:43:10", "text": "12岁，对吧？正式地说，我们接受了它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9794.71, "timestamp": "02:43:14", "text": "我们花了2小时40分钟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9797.75, "timestamp": "02:43:17", "text": "倒计时结束还有几分钟"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9801.83, "timestamp": "02:43:21", "text": "这个按钮。我大概认为会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9805.27, "timestamp": "02:43:25", "text": "工作。让我们实时观看。它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9807.51, "timestamp": "02:43:27", "text": "作品。 [笑声] 它更新了。它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9811.03, "timestamp": "02:43:31", "text": "已更新。好的。好的。所以，新的嵌入式"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9814.55, "timestamp": "02:43:34", "text": "更新程序/补丁程序看起来是这样的。这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9818.23, "timestamp": "02:43:38", "text": "将限制资本。呃，这东西呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9820.469, "timestamp": "02:43:40", "text": "缩略图会显示在那里。溪流"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9823.67, "timestamp": "02:43:43", "text": "可以查看日程安排。呃，我会改变"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9826.71, "timestamp": "02:43:46", "text": "这。不用担心。目前，我就先这样吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9828.63, "timestamp": "02:43:48", "text": "是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9831.59, "timestamp": "02:43:51", "text": "或者我也可以只放这个。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9838.309, "timestamp": "02:43:58", "text": "总之，嗯"}]